      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Middleware pipeline:\n 1 ForwardedHeaders\n 2 ExceptionHandler → ProblemDetails\n 3 CorrelationId\n 4 RequestTiming (Stopwatch + Histogram)\n 5 CORS · 6 RateLimiter (login)\n 7 Authentication (JWT + stamp)\n 8 Authorization ([RequirePermission])\n\nControllers · WorktimeHub (+HubGuardFilter)\n→ Mediator (Logging, Validation)\n→ Handlers → Domain\nKeyedLock (ConcurrentDictionary) por instancia",
      "originalText": "Middleware pipeline:\n 1 ForwardedHeaders\n 2 ExceptionHandler → ProblemDetails\n 3 CorrelationId\n 4 RequestTiming (Stopwatch + Histogram)\n 5 CORS · 6 RateLimiter (login)\n 7 Authentication (JWT + stamp)\n 8 Authorization ([RequirePermission])\n\nControllers · WorktimeHub (+HubGuardFilter)\n→ Mediator (Logging, Validation)\n→ Handlers → Domain\nKeyedLock (ConcurrentDictionary) por instancia",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
